  ['Control Plan','Not normally required','Required','Required','Required'],
  ['Quality approval of Control Plan','Not normally required','Required · Quality Engineering','Required · Quality Engineering','Required · Quality Engineering'],
  ['Readiness / resource checks','Lean safety and capability check','Formal readiness for A-sample execution','Formal readiness required','Formal readiness required'],
  ['Release / handover','Engineering conclusion and handover','Engineering conclusion and controlled handover','Formal release as configured','Formal release as configured'],
  ['Deliverables / documents','<strong>Generated: build request, route / method evidence, result record, engineering conclusion</strong>','<strong>Required / generated: build request, reviewed route / WI, approved Control Plan, material traceability, execution record, measurement / characterisation results, engineering conclusion</strong>','<strong>Required / generated: released route / WI, approved Control Plan, readiness evidence, full genealogy, test / measurement evidence, deviations, formal release record</strong>','<strong>Required / generated: production-intent route / WI, approved Control Plan, full genealogy, customer-specific evidence as applicable, quality disposition and formal release record</strong>']
