      const box=document.createElement('div');box.className=`field full callout ${status.ready?'info':'warn'} v144-material-policy`;box.innerHTML=`<strong>${esc(status.title)} · ${status.ready?'planning basis defined':'submission gate'}</strong><p>${esc(status.detail)}</p><small><b>Important:</b> a known arrival date permits downstream definition and resource planning; it does not mean the material is physically available. AUTO PLAN will not schedule the build before the material-availability date.</small>`;
